  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5002.32 “Use” means the method or manner by which explosive materials are handled and employed, but does not include storage.\n\nSource. #9765-A, eff 8-2-10 (from Saf-C 5002.29); renumbered by #12124 (from Saf-C 5002.21); ss by #12738, eff 4-30-19",
